### Health and summary
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Document stats
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/documents

### Retrieve evidence only
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/retrieve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "CNN accuracy for Alzheimer's disease MRI classification",
  "top_k": 5
}

### Ask grounded question
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "What accuracy values are reported for CNN models?",
  "top_k": 5
}

### Compare two papers
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/contradict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "doc_id_a": "first_document_id",
  "doc_id_b": "second_document_id",
  "topic": "reported model accuracy"
}

### Rebuild index
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/ingest?reset=true
